{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1000_p", "source_sha256": "047377f53bcc017950be6dc18117fb61183a97c09ae0cd186940b0b4ff64fedd", "ja": "（海美に新しい衣装を試着してもらっている。楽曲の\nイメージに合わせてみたが、気に入ってくれるかな？）", "zh": "（正在让海美试穿新服装。虽然是配合乐曲形象挑的，不知道她会不会喜欢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "0d1577d06ac635886465623909331ef7b2b8c2712944bd1c4ed1594a672bfeaa", "ja": "こんなのもいけちゃうかな？　よーし……\nうみみん☆スペシャルヨガポーズ！　わぁ、できた！", "zh": "这种也可以吗？好——……\n\n海美美☆特别瑜伽姿势！哇，成功了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2b7e1830888bcdb40c276fa6699756b0da4a3528153fe8b416cc795b35c45ef2", "ja": "お疲れ様、海美……。\nまたすごいポーズを編み出したな？", "zh": "辛苦了，海美……。\n你又想出了一个不得了的姿势啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "20b954c92456c411bb4d3de7b2452588f74367e340ea0223647b29f52db48354", "ja": "{$P$}！　今の見てた？\nこの衣装すっごく動きやすくてビックリしちゃった！", "zh": "{$P$}！刚才你看到了吗？\n这套服装超级好活动，让我都吃了一惊呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "73c1ccd95c890858a4d575aa3b211154ecc44f222852c07380221ea1af2f22ca", "ja": "どんなポーズも女子力200パーセント増量って感じ！\nほらほら、どこから見てもかわいいんだ～☆", "zh": "无论摆什么姿势，都感觉女子力增加了200个百分点！\n你看你看，从哪个角度看都很可爱吧～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1005_p", "source_sha256": "453651c23df0694ef6916cd06d9f07cb39f1ac9ef80f4f2bb54e51ebb5e199e9", "ja": "おお、本当だ！　可愛さと動きやすさには、こだわった\nからな。気に入ってくれたみたいでよかったよ。", "zh": "哦，真的耶！我可是特别注重可爱和行动方便的。你看起来很喜欢，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "181a42bad9bc513a701a43ac548279aefa932c065feb24710418e8a2b6c63c58", "ja": "うんっ、もう今すぐ踊りたいくらい！　あっ！\nそういえば、この後ってダンスレッスンだったよね！？", "zh": "嗯，我现在就想跳舞了！啊！\n说起来，接下来是舞蹈课对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4549e9289969d4db6ac4a59be8a1618651e6c487afc53a705aef80ffc6c88419", "ja": "ああ。嬉しいのはわかるけど、これは仕事の衣装だ。\nレッスンに行く時は、ちゃんと着替えること！", "zh": "是啊。我知道你很开心，但这可是工作服装。\n去上课的时候，要好好换衣服！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "04d71e679a6b5f6011c714038a980df2b34a3b5fa6cbb285bae4faa93cfc8697", "ja": "うっ……そっか。そうだよね……！\n衣装を着てる感じがしなくて、つい……えへへ。", "zh": "呜……也是呢。说得对……！\n完全没有穿着演出服的感觉，不知不觉就……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "5818d58bf7c26895fbe59d599d2910290fe1438d67bf690c2d3f836489b9673d", "ja": "私、ジャージとか水着とか、\n動きやすい服を着てると踊りたくなっちゃうみたい。", "zh": "我好像一穿上运动服啊、泳衣啊\n这种方便活动的衣服，就会忍不住想跳舞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "c3bbd84f238653c1d1325c61dfa9cba9cb144a88fc692def5cefee6fc9e508fd", "ja": "学校でもね、体育の授業中とか、掃除の時間とか\nすっごくウズウズしちゃって……あれ？", "zh": "在学校也是，体育课或者大扫除的时候，\n都会超级按捺不住……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f7343e279131b39813672da8ab4be76ef99e3f60a63dbfdad3c05b7661bcfca9", "ja": "……どうした、海美？", "zh": "……怎么了，海美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "2746f522794bcc12fbeb68cb6099e4cfc92b69c45f0e67e9e1f88f9dd841f79f", "ja": "今、思ったんだけど……私、制服でも普通に踊ってるな\nって。じゃあ、服装はあんまり関係ないのかな？", "zh": "我刚才想到……我穿着校服也照样在跳舞啊。\n这样看来，服装好像没什么关系吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1013_p", "source_sha256": "467dee801a2b375b4ada1dc2ee79380da55e03fed3783decbe8260de81e1bedd", "ja": "確かに、そうだな……。もしかしたら海美は、\n心のままに体が動いてしまうのかもな。", "zh": "确实，说得对……也许海美就是那种，\n心里想什么，身体就自然跟着动的人吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "77aebfbe95935c498a69dd2e673ffbddba59c637685f144ffbd69bee709dc4b7", "ja": "そうかも？　でもでも、この衣装を着ると、いつもより\nもっともーっと踊りたくなるのはホントだよ！", "zh": "或许吧？不过不过，穿上这身服装后，真的会比平时更想跳舞，想跳得多——更多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "e66e25a155e56d96cfcd44c1d8345d33a2f09a481a280fb1abeb8139889a9375", "ja": "女子力200パーセント！　筋力300パーセント！\nスタミナ500パーセントア～ップ！　って感じ☆", "zh": "女子魅力200百分！　体力300百分！\n耐力500百分大——提升！　就是这种感觉☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9c7fe29f65a48b992dd6c704478210a0941fc019b38571daa0b16a3d068d05b2", "ja": "そんなに！？　ははっ。パワーアップした海美が\nどんなライブを見せてくれるのか、楽しみだな。", "zh": "这么夸张！？哈哈。真期待变强后的海美会带来怎样的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "daafb43590b65b9d005a75c671356bf741ca0f9c7095f169341d9446409f4043", "ja": "うんっ！　来てくれたみーんなをニッコニコにして\nみせるよ！　もちろん{$P$}も！", "zh": "嗯！我会让到场的每一个人都笑容满面的！当然也包括{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "20bb4f466204c9e49557eed6c2f1869c1c201447781f7864457fff6adaa19bb6", "ja": "そのためにも、今から気合い入れておかないとね！\nストレッチして、それから腹筋と背筋も……ブツブツ。", "zh": "为了那个，现在就得鼓足干劲才行！先做拉伸，然后练腹肌和背肌……嘀嘀咕咕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0444_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f1877560df2713d905e774feffba3dda33187afdd07d4a545cbd3436e9e1609e", "ja": "（パワーアップした海美の元気いっぱいのライブは、\n多くの人を元気にするだろう。今から楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（活力满满、实力更上一层楼的海美，一定能用她的演唱会让许多人打起精神来。真让人期待啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
